	abstract = {The usage of social media has become very common in day-to-day life. However, it has been found that few people are misbehaving with others, by means of vulgar words. These have negative impacts on the targeted persons which are called as cyberbullying. In lieu of the same, in this paper cyberbullying content is detected and appropriate actions are taken against the person who bullies others. We are using social media platform “Reddit” to detect cyberbullying content and have developed rules to automatically detect the same. In our paper, we have used “Ensemble Learning”, an algorithm of machine learning, through which we will be detecting the language patterns used by bullies and victims. Ensemble method is unique in that it combines multiple base models to output an optimal predictive model. Therefore, for the base models, we have used Bow, TFIDF and SVM, and then we have combined them through the ensemble method “Voting” in order to produce a much better proven optimal predictive model. © 2022, The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Singapore Pte Ltd.},
